            <div xml:id="d870">

                <pb facs="0798" n="682" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg682"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 882.51/411.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Special Representative to the Secretary of
                        State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hamburg</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-07-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 11, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Falkner should be informed that interest at five per cent is demanded by the
                    creditors from July 1.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Skinner.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
